g.', 'A stage of the TinyBERT learning framework, occurring during pre-training.', 'A stage in the two-stage learning framework, used during pre-training.', 'A stage in the two-stage learning framework where TinyBERT learns knowledge from intermediate layers of the teacher BERT during pre-training.', 'The first stage of the two-stage learning framework in TinyBERT, performed during pre-training on a large-scale corpus.'], 'type': ['GENERIC', 'method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 3, 4, 6, 7, 8, 11, 12, 13, 14, 16]}, 'Task-specific Distillation (TD)': {'description': ["The second stage of TinyBERT's two-stage learning framework, occurring during fine-tuning.", 'A stage in the two-stage learning framework, used during fine-tuning.', 'The second stage of the two-stage learning framework, performed during fine-tuning, where TinyBERT learns task-specific knowledge from BERT, often with data augmentation.', 'The second stage of the two-stage learning framework in TinyBERT, used during fine-tuning for specific tasks.', 'A stage in the two-stage learning framework where TinyBERT is fine-tuned on a task-specific dataset, often with data augmentation.', 'The second stage of the two-stage learning framework, where TinyBERT is fine-tuned on a specific task, improving its performance.', 'A stage in the two-stage TinyBERT learning framework focused on fine-tuning the model for specific tasks.', 'A key procedure in the two-stage TinyBERT learning framework, used during fine-tuning to transfer knowledge from the teacher model (BERT) to the student model (TinyBERT) for specific tasks.', 'The second stage of the two-stage framework for TinyBERT learning, used during fine-tuning.', 'A stage of the TinyBERT learning framework, occurring during fine-tuning.', 'A stage in the two-stage learning framework, used during fine-tuning.', 'A stage in the TinyBERT training framework, applied during fine-tuning on specific tasks.', 'A stage in the two-stage learning framework where TinyBERT learns task-specific knowledge during fine-tuning.'], 'type': ['GENERIC', 'method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 3, 4, 6, 7, 8, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15, 16]}, 'Transformer distillation method': {'description': ['A novel method specifically designed for knowledge distillation of Transformer-based models, aimed at accelerating inference and reducing model size while maintaining accuracy.', 'A key aspect of the knowledge distillation process, specifically focusing on distilling knowledge from the Transformer layers of BERT.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 12]}, 'Data Augmentation (DA)': {'description': ['A technique used to increase the diversity of a dataset by creating modified versions of existing data, often used in conjunction with the two-stage learning framework.', 'The process of creating more task-related materials to enhance teacher-student learning, particularly during the task-specific distillation stage.', 'A method used to extend the task-specific training set, often employed during task-specific distillation.', 'The process of increasing the diversity of the training data, used in conjunction with the two-stage distillation process.', 'A technique used to increase the diversity of the training data, often employed during fine-tuning.', 'A key procedure in the two-stage TinyBERT learning framework, used to increase the diversity of the training data.', 'A method used to enhance the training data, potentially improving the performance of TinyBERT.', 'The process of augmenting the dataset to improve model performance.'], 'type': ['GENERIC', 'method', 'generic'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 3, 4, 7, 8, 11, 13, 14]}, 'Attention matrices': {'description': ['Matrices derived from the Transformer layer in BERT, used to capture linguistic knowledge and transfer it to TinyBERT during distillation.', 'Matrices within the Transformer that capture linguistic knowledge and are crucial for the distillation process, transferring knowledge from BERT to TinyBERT.', 'Intermediate representations within the Transformer architecture that capture relationships between words and are used in knowledge distillation.', 'Used to capture linguistic knowledge and transfer it from teacher BERT to student TinyBERT.'], 'type': ['GENERIC', 'generic'], 'source_chunk_index': [3, 5, 6, 15]}, 'Task-specific Distillation': {'description': ['The second stage of the two-stage learning framework in TinyBERT, performed during fine-tuning on a task-specific dataset.', 'A stage in the two-stage learning framework where TinyBERT is fine-tuned on specific tasks, such as those in the GLUE benchmark.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [3, 15]}, 'Transformer distillation': {'description': ['The method used to transfer linguistic knowledge from the teacher BERT to the student TinyBERT.', 'Encouraging the transfer of linguistic knowledge from the teacher BERT to TinyBERT.', 'A specially designed Knowledge Distillation (KD) method for Transformer-based models, which is the core of TinyBERT.', 'A specially designed Knowledge Distillation method for Transformer networks.', 'A key aspect of the knowledge distillation process, specifically focusing on distilling knowledge from the Transformer layers of BERT.'], 'type': ['task', 'method'], 'source_chunk_index': [12, 4, 5, 6]}, 'Embedding-layer distillation': {'description': ['A distillation method applied to the embedding layer.', 'A baseline method for TinyBERT learning that excludes embedding-layer distillation, used for comparison.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [11, 6]}, 'Prediction-layer distillation': {'description': ['A distillation method applied to the prediction layer.', 'A baseline method for TinyBERT learning that excludes prediction-layer distillation, used for comparison.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [11, 6]}, 'Prediction-layer Distillation': {'description': ['A specific distillation technique mentioned in the text, likely referring to the process of transferring knowledge from the prediction layer of the teacher model (BERT) to the student model (TinyBERT).', 'A specific distillation technique focused on transferring knowledge from the prediction layer of the teacher model (BERT) to the student model (TinyBERT).', 'A baseline method for TinyBERT learning that excludes prediction-layer distillation, used for comparison.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [11, 7]}, 'Model size': {'description': ['The number of parameters in a model, a key factor in the comparison between BERT and TinyBERT.', 'The amount of memory a model occupies, a key factor in deployment on edge devices.'], 'type': ['GENERIC'], 'source_chunk_index': [8, 13]}, 'Transformer-layer distillation (No Trm)': {'description': ['A baseline method for TinyBERT learning that excludes Transformer-layer distillation, used for comparison.', 'A key aspect of the knowledge distillation process, specifically focusing on distilling knowledge from the Transformer layers of BERT.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [11, 12]}}
